OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAActivists found guilty of theft of
OL,4,AKing's lambs
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the jury of five men and seven
OL,7,Fwomen at Norwich Crown Court
OL,8,Funanimously found all three guilty of
OL,9,Ftheft. They were each sentenced to a
OL,10,F12-month community order of 150 hours
OL,11,Fof unpaid work, and they must each pay
OL,12,F#250 towards prosecution costs.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
